Package: PenguinoidRTools
Type: Package
Title: Miscellaneous Useful R Functions for Statistics and Colour Science
Version: 0.7
Author: Gavin Duley <gduley@gmail.com>
Maintainer: Gavin Duley <gduley@gmail.com>
Description: Useful R functions for statistical analysis and colour science.
    Includes ANOVA summary tables with Tukey HSD groupings and
    Benjamini-Hochberg corrections, and CIELab colour calculations from
    spectrophotometry data using the OIV-MA-AS2-11 method.
